{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "被买走的顺序",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 128.6,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先说一个词：MEV，最大可提取价值。",
   "spoken": "先说一个词：MEV，最大可提取价值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.248,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 5.007
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "它指的是，区块生产者或者搜索者，通过安排交易顺序、插入或排除交易，拿到的额外收益。",
   "spoken": "它指的是，区块生产者或者搜索者，通过安排交易顺序、插入或排除交易，拿到的额外收益。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 6.068,
   "dur": 8.448,
   "speechStart": 6.166,
   "speechEnd": 13.666
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "搜索者，是专门寻找这类机会，把交易捆成一组提交的人或程序。",
   "spoken": "搜索者，是专门寻找这类机会，把交易捆成一组提交的人或程序。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 14.736,
   "dur": 5.832,
   "speechStart": 14.834,
   "speechEnd": 19.726
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "搜索者把捆绑包交给区块构建者，构建者再把整个区块，卖给提议者。",
   "spoken": "搜索者把捆绑包交给区块构建者，构建者再把整个区块，卖给提议者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 20.788,
   "dur": 6.264,
   "speechStart": 20.886,
   "speechEnd": 26.219
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "这叫提议者与构建者分离。结果是，排序权可以被购买。",
   "spoken": "这叫提议者与构建者分离。结果是，排序权可以被购买。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 27.272,
   "dur": 5.784,
   "speechStart": 27.37,
   "speechEnd": 32.201
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "MEV 有三种形态。",
   "spoken": "MEV 有三种形态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 33.276,
   "dur": 2.784,
   "speechStart": 33.374,
   "speechEnd": 35.219
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "第一种，抢跑：攻击者排在你前面。",
   "spoken": "第一种，抢跑：攻击者排在你前面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 36.28,
   "dur": 3.744,
   "speechStart": 36.378,
   "speechEnd": 39.199
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "比如一道谜题，第一个提交答案的人领奖。机器人复制你的答案，出更高的小费，先成交。",
   "spoken": "比如一道谜题，第一个提交答案的人领奖。机器人复制你的答案，出更高的小费，先成交。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 40.244,
   "dur": 8.112,
   "speechStart": 40.342,
   "speechEnd": 47.506
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "第二种，三明治：攻击者先买，你再买，攻击者最后卖。",
   "spoken": "第二种，三明治：攻击者先买，你再买，攻击者最后卖。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 48.576,
   "dur": 5.88,
   "speechStart": 48.674,
   "speechEnd": 53.638
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "他利用的，是你设定的滑点容忍度。",
   "spoken": "他利用的，是你设定的滑点容忍度。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 54.676,
   "dur": 3.768,
   "speechStart": 54.774,
   "speechEnd": 57.607
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "第三种，尾随：攻击者排在你后面，吃掉你的交易留下的套利或清算机会。",
   "spoken": "第三种，尾随：攻击者排在你后面，吃掉你的交易留下的套利或清算机会。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 58.664,
   "dur": 6.984,
   "speechStart": 58.762,
   "speechEnd": 64.797
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "尾随通常没有直接的受害者。",
   "spoken": "尾随通常没有直接的受害者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 65.868,
   "dur": 2.952,
   "speechStart": 65.966,
   "speechEnd": 67.989
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "回到三明治，拆开看。",
   "spoken": "回到三明治，拆开看。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 69.04,
   "dur": 2.952,
   "speechStart": 69.138,
   "speechEnd": 71.173
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "你的交易进入公开内存池。",
   "spoken": "你的交易进入公开内存池。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 72.212,
   "dur": 3.096,
   "speechStart": 72.31,
   "speechEnd": 74.476
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "搜索者发现它，捆成一包：自己买入，你的交易，自己卖出。",
   "spoken": "搜索者发现它，捆成一包：自己买入，你的交易，自己卖出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 75.528,
   "dur": 6.168,
   "speechStart": 75.626,
   "speechEnd": 80.864
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "构建者按这个顺序打包。",
   "spoken": "构建者按这个顺序打包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 81.916,
   "dur": 2.592,
   "speechStart": 82.014,
   "speechEnd": 83.668
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "搜索者先买，把价格推高。",
   "spoken": "搜索者先买，把价格推高。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 84.728,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 84.826,
   "speechEnd": 86.766
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "你按更坏的价格成交，刚好满足最小输出。",
   "spoken": "你按更坏的价格成交，刚好满足最小输出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 87.828,
   "dur": 4.176,
   "speechStart": 87.926,
   "speechEnd": 91.152
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "搜索者再卖回去，赚走中间的利润。",
   "spoken": "搜索者再卖回去，赚走中间的利润。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-18.mp3",
   "start": 92.224,
   "dur": 3.72,
   "speechStart": 92.322,
   "speechEnd": 95.107
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "他最多能赚多少，由你的最小输出决定。滑点设得越宽，被夹得越狠。",
   "spoken": "他最多能赚多少，由你的最小输出决定。滑点设得越宽，被夹得越狠。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-19.mp3",
   "start": 96.164,
   "dur": 6.696,
   "speechStart": 96.262,
   "speechEnd": 102.021
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "打个比方。你在拍卖会上举牌之前，大声说出了自己的最高出价。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。你在拍卖会上举牌之前，大声说出了自己的最高出价。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-20.mp3",
   "start": 103.08,
   "dur": 6.048,
   "speechStart": 103.178,
   "speechEnd": 108.294
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "旁边的人抢先用低一点的价格买下，再加价转卖给你。",
   "spoken": "旁边的人抢先用低一点的价格买下，再加价转卖给你。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-21.mp3",
   "start": 109.348,
   "dur": 4.776,
   "speechStart": 109.446,
   "speechEnd": 113.303
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-22",
   "text": "比喻在这里不成立：拍卖会上，你能看到谁插了队。",
   "spoken": "比喻在这里不成立：拍卖会上，你能看到谁插了队。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-22.mp3",
   "start": 114.344,
   "dur": 4.92,
   "speechStart": 114.442,
   "speechEnd": 118.43
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-23",
   "text": "链上的三明治，和你的交易在同一个区块里。普通用户往往只看到，成交价比预期低。",
   "spoken": "链上的三明治，和你的交易在同一个区块里。普通用户往往只看到，成交价比预期低。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-23.mp3",
   "start": 119.484,
   "dur": 7.92,
   "speechStart": 119.582,
   "speechEnd": 126.579
  }
